(360, 1, '2017-10-30 01:42:28', '2017-10-29 22:42:28', '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Content:</h3>\r\n<p>Volumes:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 - 2nd volume was presented on 16.11.2016 within the 21st General Assembly of the Association of National Olympic Committees (ANOC) in Doha to the IOC President Thomas Bach and the President of the ANOC H.E. Sheikh Ahmad Al-Fahad Al-Sabah.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3rd volume - presented by Aldons Vrublevskis, President of the Latvian Olympic Committee, in honor of the 95th anniversary of the organization on May 1, 2017 in Riga.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4th volume - presented in the framework of the XXII ANOC General Assembly in November 2017, Prague, Czech Republic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The publishing program of the project from 5th to 12th volume - until 2021.</p>', 'Project1', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '203-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-10-30 01:42:28', '2017-10-29 22:42:28', '', 203, 'http://olymphub.com/2017/10/30/203-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(361, 1, '2017-10-30 01:43:21', '2017-10-29 22:43:21', '“It is an outstanding expression of Olympic Spirit. Embarking on such a monumental task is a true act of bravery, well done and congratulations also to all of the team that was involved in its production”.', 'Raffaele Pagnozzi', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '112-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-10-30 01:43:21', '2017-10-29 22:43:21', '', 112, 'http://olymphub.com/2017/10/30/112-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
