(508, 106, '_h_sec2_column_content_2_title', 'field_59f4fba67be94'),
(509, 106, 'h_sec2_column_content_2_description', 'Smart contract on blockсhain, guarantees protection of copyright and property rights. The system automates royalty payments to content creators, and rents to digital asset owners'),
(510, 106, '_h_sec2_column_content_2_description', 'field_59f4fbb87be95'),
(511, 106, 'h_sec2_column_content', '3'),
(512, 106, '_h_sec2_column_content', 'field_59f4fb567be92'),
(513, 106, 'h_sec3_heading', 'YOUR DIGITAL LANDS'),
(514, 106, '_h_sec3_heading', 'field_59f501a31d0e4'),
(515, 106, 'h_sec3_image', '101'),
(516, 106, '_h_sec3_image', 'field_59f501b51d0e5'),
(517, 106, 'h_sec3_text_content', 'Digital land is the main asset of the Arcona ecosystem, built on the principles of blockchain. The rules of land use are described in the Ethereum smart contract. You can buy your own lot in exchange for an ERC20 standard token - arcon.\r\n\r\nWhy should you buy digital land? Owning a lot of Digital Land is an interesting experience for a creative person and a profitable business for business people. You can change the world on the lawn in front of your house or create serious commercial project thousands of kilometers away from you, on another continent.\r\n\r\nYour land - your rules. Each lot of the digital land is associated with a specific location in the physical world. This is a place where you will be attracting many people to share with them the results of your work.\r\n\r\nOrganize events, shows and presentations, create games, open virtual stores. Digital land is your property, organize it to your taste.\r\n\r\nYou absolutely need Digital Land if you want to create augmented reality online projects anywhere on the planet.'),
(518, 106, '_h_sec3_text_content', 'field_59f501c91d0e6'),
