(22106, 281, 'h_sec7_road_map_3_description', 'We already have launched  8 AR outdoor parks in 6 countries: Russia, France, Latvia, Italy, Estonia and Bulgaria.Started to develop our own augmented reality platform to remotely positioning and  management digital assets .'),
