(23022, 283, 'h_sec6_image', ''),
(23023, 283, '_h_sec6_image', 'field_59f5ab5b2cd87'),
(23024, 283, 'h_sec6_top_text_content', 'The Arcona platform is being developed by the professional team of PiligrimXXI. We became the first Russian IT start-up operating in the international augmented reality market in the travel industry.\r\n\r\nWe have given tourists the opportunity to combine real travel and time travel. Using a smartphone and AR headset, travelers can see with their own eyes the vanished architectural wonders of the past and witness historical events in real time and space.\r\n\r\nIn 2014, Piligrim XXI launched the world\'s first outdoor augmented reality park, and today a network of 8 such parks with a total area of 7,700 ar operates in 6 countries.\r\n\r\nSince 2015, PiligrimXXI has been actively investing its own funds in research in the field of distributed GIS system, Augmented Reality technologies, 3D simulations, Computer vision and Artificial Intelligence.\r\n\r\nWe are launching an ITO in order to start the process of generating Digital Land as early as 2019. The first digitized territories will appear in the 10 largest cities in the world - New York, London, Paris, Tokyo, Beijing, Rome, Mexico, St. Petersburg, Istanbul and Barcelona.\r\n\r\nBut even before the launch of the platform, in the first half of 2018, we will be publicly releasing our ARViewer and a Marketplace where everybody will be able to use arcon tokens for payments.'),
