(24494, 286, 'home_banner_notes_beside_the_countdown', 'Token Sale Start by 27.11.2017\r\nArcona Token Sale: 1 USD = 1 arcona\r\nArcona token will be used for the purchase of all digital goods and services within the ecosystem.'),
