(31890, 315, 'h_sec7_road_map_5_description', 'After the completion of the ITO, a marketplace will be launched, one of the tasks of which will be to put the Arcon token into circulation as a system payment means. Involving independent experts in the development and creation of content.'),
(31891, 315, '_h_sec7_road_map_5_description', 'field_59f50aaa13a12'),
