(42645, 364, 'h_sec8_adviser_members_3_description', 'Entrepreneur and Merchant Banker with broad experience in all aspects of forming, managing, advising, fund raising, and biz dev for entrepreneur-powered businesses, including, business strategy and M&A. Advisor or co-founder of global ICOs and Token offerings.'),
