(42637, 364, 'h_sec8_adviser_members_2_description', 'CEO and co -founder of Lampix, an AR technology platform. Founder and Editor in Chief of Lending Times, a media company in the peer-to -peer, market place and online lending space. Chairman of the Board of advisors of Gatecoin, having raised $5.8mil for 1st Blood ICO, $14mil for Lampix ICO, $15mil for AirFox'),
