(42230, 364, '_h_sec1_text_content', 'field_59f4f66e924fc'),
(42229, 364, 'h_sec1_text_content', 'The Arcona Ecosystem creates a Digital Land - a layer of Augmented Reality uniting the physical and virtual worlds into a single information environment perfectly linked to our real world. It is designed for everyday user interactive experience with augmented, virtual and mixed reality multimedia content in real world locations.'),
