(45006, 370, '_home_banner_top_buttons', 'field_59f4ea9061b70'),
(45007, 370, 'home_banner_heading', '是将虚拟和现实世界结合在单一生态系统中的信息空间。'),
(45008, 370, '_home_banner_heading', 'field_59f4eb4e6b25d'),
(45009, 370, 'home_banner_sub_heading', '它基于在地面创建带有自然标记的增强现实层连接的平台，<br>用于远程定位和虚拟内容管理。'),
(45010, 370, '_home_banner_sub_heading', 'field_59f4eb606b25e'),
(45011, 370, 'home_banner_notes_beside_the_countdown', 'Arcona Token   -  1 ARN = 1 USD\r\nArcona token will be used for the purchase of all digital goods and services within the ecosystem. '),
(45012, 370, '_home_banner_notes_beside_the_countdown', 'field_59f4eb726b25f'),
(45013, 370, 'home_banner_subscribe_button_title', 'SUBSCRIBE WHITELIST'),
(45014, 370, '_home_banner_subscribe_button_title', 'field_59f4ebd36b260'),
(45015, 370, 'h_sec1_heading', '增强现实生态系统'),
(45016, 370, '_h_sec1_heading', 'field_59f4f653924fb'),
(45017, 370, 'h_sec1_text_content', '我们把这一层称之为“数字土地”，与使用地理空间数据的真实地形直接相关。数字土地具有自然界限：人类掌握的12%的陆地。这种稀缺资产是商品和生态系统经济的基础。'),
(45018, 370, '_h_sec1_text_content', 'field_59f4f66e924fc'),
(45019, 370, 'h_sec1_link_for_the_text_content', 'https://www.arcona.io/'),
(45020, 370, '_h_sec1_link_for_the_text_content', 'field_59f4f6a2924fd'),
(45021, 370, 'h_sec1_youtube_video_embedcode', '<iframe height=\"100%\" width=\"100%\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" title=\"External YouTube\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/SwJ1kBraqs0?wmode=transparent&autoplay=0&theme=dark&controls=0&autohide=0&loop=1&showinfo=0&rel=0&playlist=SwJ1kBraqs0&enablejsapi=0\"></iframe>'),
(45022, 370, '_h_sec1_youtube_video_embedcode', 'field_59f4f6b2924fe'),
(45023, 370, 'h_sec2_heading', '生态系统主要特点'),
(45024, 370, '_h_sec2_heading', 'field_59f4fb467be91'),
(45025, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_0_image', '92'),
(45026, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_0_image', 'field_59f4fb817be93'),
(45027, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_0_title', '远程设置'),
(45028, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_0_title', 'field_59f4fba67be94'),
(45029, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_0_description', '增强现实的远程定位和内容管理系统。您将能够将您的设备远程放置在地球上的任何地方。你将可以访问有许多旅游热门地点，在那里你可以布置好与实际空间融合的整个虚拟世界。'),
(45030, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_0_description', 'field_59f4fbb87be95'),
(45031, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_1_image', '94'),
(45032, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_1_image', 'field_59f4fb817be93'),
(45033, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_1_title', '建筑和贸易'),
(45034, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_1_title', 'field_59f4fba67be94'),
(45035, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_1_description', '您可以在真实场所开设虚拟商店，并销售任何商品。你不得不拥有自己的数字土地，如果你想在线（online）在地球上的任何地方不用离开家门而做所有事情。'),
(45036, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_1_description', 'field_59f4fbb87be95'),
(45037, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_2_image', '93'),
(45038, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_2_image', 'field_59f4fb817be93'),
(45039, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_2_title', '安全你的财产'),
(45040, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_2_title', 'field_59f4fba67be94'),
(45041, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content_2_description', '区块链技术的利用确保平等的条件和额外的保障，以保护Arcona平台数字地区的所有者的财产权，以及生活在世界任何国家的开发者和艺术家的版权。区块链技术使系统内的所有交易更加可靠，透明和移动'),
(45042, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content_2_description', 'field_59f4fbb87be95'),
(45043, 370, 'h_sec2_column_content', '3'),
(45044, 370, '_h_sec2_column_content', 'field_59f4fb567be92'),
(45045, 370, 'h_sec3_heading', '你的数字土地'),
(45046, 370, '_h_sec3_heading', 'field_59f501a31d0e4'),
(45047, 370, 'h_sec3_image', ''),
(45048, 370, '_h_sec3_image', 'field_59f501b51d0e5'),
(45049, 370, 'h_sec3_text_content', 'Arcona系统经济是基于称为“数字土地”的增强现实层的生成。\r\n这是在Ethereum智能合同中描述的有限的数字资产。它可以通过交换一个称为arcon的ERC20代币来购买。\r\n拥有数字土地 - 这是对有创造性的人来说是有趣的经验，和对有进取心的人来说是有利可图的职业。你购买土地以便在现实世界中放置由你制造的或在市场购买的虚拟对象。我的土地 - 我做主。\r\n你可以在房子前面的草坪上改变世界，或在距离你数千公里外的另一个大陆开展重大的商业项目。现实数字层 - 这是按自己的口味装备的自己的领地。\r\n数字土地每一个区块都与物理世界中的特定位置相关联。你可以吸引真人到该地方，与他们分享自己的劳动结果，安排演出、演示，创建游戏。\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-center\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/59e434_fd535bbbd6a44ccab2f5b300f3892c0b_mv2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>'),
(45050, 370, '_h_sec3_text_content', 'field_59f501c91d0e6'),
(45051, 370, 'h_sec4_heading', ''),
(45052, 370, '_h_sec4_heading', 'field_59f503ac089e2'),
(45053, 370, 'h_sec4_image', ''),
(45054, 370, '_h_sec4_image', 'field_59f503c4089e3'),
(45055, 370, 'h_sec5_heading', 'ARCONA TOKEN SALE'),
(45056, 370, '_h_sec5_heading', 'field_59f5069450063'),
(45057, 370, 'h_sec5_text_content', '<p class=\"type1\">Arcona will be introduced in the first quarter of 2018</p>\r\n<p class=\"type2\">The arcona token help you to purchase digital lands and other digital assets.</p>\r\n<p class=\"type2\">You can get arcona as a reward for performing tasks set by the Arcona system.</p>\r\n<p class=\"type3\">Total emission — 100 000 000 arconas</p>\r\n<p class=\"type4\">DISTRIBUTION OF TOKENS</p>'),
(45058, 370, '_h_sec5_text_content', 'field_59f506dd50064'),
(45059, 370, 'h_sec5_image', '115'),
(45060, 370, '_h_sec5_image', 'field_59f5074750065'),
(45061, 370, 'h_sec5_subscribe_button_text', ''),
(45062, 370, '_h_sec5_subscribe_button_text', 'field_59fb496893fd7'),
(45063, 370, 'h_sec5_section_id_with_hash_to_scroll', ''),
(45064, 370, '_h_sec5_section_id_with_hash_to_scroll', 'field_59fb499393fd8'),
(45065, 370, 'h_sec6_heading', 'WHO IF NOT US?'),
(45066, 370, '_h_sec6_heading', 'field_59f5ab312cd86'),
(45067, 370, 'h_sec6_image', ''),
(45068, 370, '_h_sec6_image', 'field_59f5ab5b2cd87'),
(45069, 370, 'h_sec6_top_text_content', 'The Arcona platform is being developed by the professional team of PiligrimXXI. We became the first Russian IT start-up operating in the international augmented reality market in the travel industry.\r\n\r\nWe have given tourists the opportunity to combine real travel and time travel. Using a smartphone and AR headset, travelers can see with their own eyes the vanished architectural wonders of the past and witness historical events in real time and space.\r\n\r\nIn 2014, Piligrim XXI launched the world\'s first outdoor augmented reality park, and today a network of 8 such parks with a total area of 7,700 ar operates in 6 countries.\r\n\r\nSince 2015, PiligrimXXI has been actively investing its own funds in research in the field of distributed GIS system, Augmented Reality technologies, 3D simulations, Computer vision and Artificial Intelligence.\r\n\r\nWe are launching an ITO in order to start the process of generating Digital Land as early as 2019. The first digitized territories will appear in the 10 largest cities in the world - New York, London, Paris, Tokyo, Beijing, Rome, Mexico, St. Petersburg, Istanbul and Barcelona.\r\n\r\nBut even before the launch of the platform, in the first half of 2018, we will be publicly releasing our ARViewer and a Marketplace where everybody will be able to use arcon tokens for payments.'),
(45070, 370, '_h_sec6_top_text_content', 'field_59f5ab7d2cd88'),
